{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062840/block/singleImage/3262239/df/01M6ZV97GHC427TY6ERP3N91VW.jpg?updatedAt=1794217762\"/><figcaption>毛記葵涌盈警，主要受行政開支增加拖累（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>毛記葵涌（ 1716 ）發盈警，預期集團於截至 2026 年 9 月 30 日止六個月，將錄得公司擁有人應佔綜合虧損不多於 270 萬港元，而去年同期則錄得公司擁有人應佔綜合溢利則為 89.4 萬港元。 毛記葵涌報告中提及，虧損主要歸因於行政開支增加。期內，由於管理人員的擴充，導致員工成本相應增加，以及專業費用錄得顯著增長，進一步導致行政費用整體上升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.669998+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:49:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:15:50.362736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:53.155112+00:00","content_hash":"3cbb0628e634ec13c9ad36724b58bf41c3015aa5dea98d5202cb661c7d92e134","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.669998+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}